---

Educational/research use only. This is a proof of concept for learning
Windows GUI kernel internals (win32k) in an isolated test VM, operating
exclusively on windows owned by the user's own process. It is NOT intended
or supported as a tool to bypass screen-capture protection on third-party
applications, DRM content, banking apps, exam proctoring software, or any
protected content the user does not own. The authors accept no responsibility
for misuse.
